FFIILLEE FFOORRMMAATT
     Drawings are plain text, one object per line, in grid units;
     unknown lines are skipped, so old readers accept new files:

                  vellum1
                  U 5 mm
                  Y NPN 20 30 0 0 Q1 -
                  W 10 10 20 10
                  L 5 5 9 9 /1.0
                  T 12 4 s1 Power supply
                  S box 60 10 75 20 Fetch
                  K harrow 67 20 67 24 @67,20 -
                  P 3 5 50 10 55 5 60
                  A 30 50 4 0 180
                  N 17 10 OUT
                  D 10 40 24 40
                  G 2

     YY symbol, WW wire, LL line, BB box, CC circle, TT text (with an
     ss_n size), SS a stretchable shape, KK a connector whose ends
     are `-' (free) or @_x,_y (the attachment's grid point, re-
     resolved on load), PP a polyline, AA an arc (centre, radius,
     angles), NN a net name, DD a dimension (empty text = the
     automatic label), UU the sheet-units header and GG a group
     header covering the following n objects.  An optional /_f_l_a_g_s
     ._l_a_y_e_r token carries line style, fill, bold, hatch, smooth,
     vertical text and the layer.

